    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺たちに、イベントへのオファー？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ひょっとして、この間Legendersが出た\nお掃除番組のおかげッスかね？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あれ以降、315プロの知名度が\nどんどん上がってる気がするッス！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "番組だか何だか知らねーが、オレ様に話が来るのは\nトーゼンだろ！　っつーか、来るのが遅すぎんだよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（イベントへの出演……うまくいけば、\n弟と妹の目にも留まるかもしれない）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……出よう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ！　どんな仕事でも全力で引き受けるッスよ、\n●●●●●●●●●●師匠！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "んで？　相手はなんて言ってきてんだよ。　\nしょーもねー仕事じゃねーだろうなァ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今回のお仕事は、皆さんの格闘家としての経歴を\n見込んで、声をかけてくれたもので……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "『Victory Rush!』という、\n格闘技イベントの前座なんです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "じゃ、強えヤツをぶっ飛ばせんのか。\n面白そうじゃねーか！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はは、違うぞ、漣。\nみんなの前でパフォーマンスをするんだぞ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい。今回の皆さんのお仕事は、\n格闘ではなくライブステージになります。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 28,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "きっと、このお仕事は私たちにとって\n重要なものになると思います！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_05_a:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
